Subject: [PATCH] RomCore embedding: library build (AGP 9.2.1), SDL Java
 package org.libsdl.apptwoship + libSDL2twoship.so, embedded MainActivity
 mode, headless ROM extraction, dropped toasts, per-core asset root, JNI keep
 rules

